nity dance school. Unlike her friends, she doesn't want to be a principal dancer when she grows up, and she's a bit scared of being on stage, but it's still one of her favourite hobbies.  \n\nUntil Miss Diamond announces that this term they'll be putting on a performance of Cinderella! Suddenly everyone's talking about what lead role they want and how fun it will be to dance for an audience, and Indu is feeling nervous and left out.  What role will she audition for? Will her friends understand her worries? And will she ever be able to conquer her stage fright?  \n\nA fun, inclusive and accessible series that will bring the joy of dance to young listeners.","audioPreviewUrl":"https://audio-previews-media.api.yotoplay.com/audio-previews/6cf89344938084f1b92219093d02902dd188ec2aaf672f74a5a482d7c8844d80/xQ-lE4pW8dbdoea6Zip1RupjycEOBHqJK9n3qyrQs2M.mp3","cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/UYLtHyaOnooXC6NgQS9iCuV9fa-0BrcVrFg7MftKqk8"},"languages":["en"],"media":{"duration":11984,"fileSize":193840329,"hasStreams":false},"status":{"name":"complete","updatedAt":"2025-10-20T15:30:03.244Z"}},"cardId":"f5yJO","createdAt":"2024-11-08T16:53:36.015Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-05T15:45:17.059Z"},"ownership":{"canAccess":true,"userHasRole":false,"cardIsFree":false,"cardIsMadeByUser":false,"cardIsInFamilyLibrary":false,"cardIsCreatedByFamily":false,"isAccessibleUsingSubscription":false,"isAccessibleAsPhysicalPlay":false,"isShareLink":false,"isReconditionCard":false,"inCardPacks":false,"previewAccessOnly":true}}